<TAI OPT="RDM"><TXT>NOTE 2:  For RDM, </TXT>maintain the coefficient of uniformity (CU) greater than 3.5 (CU = D60/D10).  Adjust the RDM 
gradation within the ranges listed in Table 2 to provide a stable construction surface for the proposed equipment 
and method of transporting materials.  Stabilize the RDM drainage layer with Portland cement or asphalt at no additional 
cost, if approved during the test section.</TAI><BRK/>
